        "solution": "💡 ALTIN FORMÜL / KURAL:\n(f + g)(x) = f(x) + g(x)\n\n🪜 ADIM ADIM ÇÖZÜM:\n1. f(3) = 2(3) + 3 = 6 + 3 = 9\n2. g(3) = 3² - 1 = 9 - 1 = 8\n3. (f + g)(3) = f(3) + g(3) = 9 + 8 = 17 bulunur.",
